WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.338 --> 00:00:13.743
Megan was brushing her teeth.

2
00:00:13.744 --> 00:00:18.042
She left the water running.

3
00:00:18.043 --> 00:00:20.693
Sam banged on the door.

4
00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:23.693
"It's Earth Day!" he said.

5
00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:31.080
"Don't waste water!"

6
00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:34.403
Downstairs Dad collected bottles.

7
00:00:34.404 --> 00:00:36.499
Mom collected paper.

8
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:43.280
"Recycling is good for the earth," said Dad.

9
00:00:43.281 --> 00:00:50.631
After breakfast Megan gathered food scraps.

10
00:00:50.632 --> 00:00:54.348
She and Dad took them outside to the compost.

11
00:00:54.349 --> 00:00:59.340
"Compost is good for the garden," said Dad.

12
00:00:59.341 --> 00:01:03.337
Megan saw a strange box in the yard.

13
00:01:03.338 --> 00:01:06.419
"What's that box?" asked Megan.

14
00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.431
"You'll see later," said Dad with a wink.

15
00:01:10.432 --> 00:01:12.684
Mom and Sam came outside.

16
00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:16.072
"Let's go grocery shopping," said Mom.

17
00:01:16.073 --> 00:01:18.484
"Okay," Megan said.

18
00:01:18.485 --> 00:01:21.900
"I'll get lunch ready here," said Dad.

19
00:01:21.901 --> 00:01:24.504
Megan stepped toward the car.

20
00:01:24.505 --> 00:01:27.164
"Let's walk," said Mom.

21
00:01:27.165 --> 00:01:35.346
"It's better for the environment."

22
00:01:35.347 --> 00:01:38.860
At the store a clerk got some plastic bags.

23
00:01:38.861 --> 00:01:43.315
"No thanks. We brought canvas shopping bags," said Mom.

24
00:01:43.316 --> 00:01:48.673
"They are better for the earth."

25
00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:56.192
Everyone was hungry after the long walk home.

26
00:01:56.193 --> 00:02:00.186
"I smell pizza!" said Megan.

27
00:02:00.187 --> 00:02:03.519
"Remember the box?" said Dad.

28
00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:08.161
"It's a solar oven!"

29
00:02:08.162 --> 00:02:16.088
"Awesome! The sun cooked the pizza," said Megan.

30
00:02:16.089 --> 00:02:22.123
"I love Earth Day!"
